# Feature: plugin-ciutatis-compat

## Purpose

Extract Ciutatis fork-specific Paperclip deviations into an installable plugin so upstream plugin extensions stay merge-safe.

## Package

- Name: `@ciutatis/plugin-ciutatis-compat`
- Path: `packages/plugins/plugin-ciutatis-compat`
- Plugin id: `ciutatis.fork-compat`

## What it surfaces

- Civic aliases: company→institution, issue→request, goal→objective
- SDK aliases: PaperclipPlugin↔CiutatisPlugin, PaperclipPluginManifestV1↔CiutatisPluginManifestV1
- Deferred upstream features catalog (routines runtime, telemetry, board-auth CLI, company-skills library)

## Host wiring

- Thin stubs: `packages/shared/src/fork-compat/upstream-stubs.ts`
- Civic barrel: `packages/shared/src/civic-exports.ts` re-exported from shared `index.ts`
- Upstream shared index restored for full plugin type surface

## Build / install

```sh
pnpm --filter @paperclipai/shared build
pnpm --filter @paperclipai/plugin-sdk build
pnpm --filter @ciutatis/plugin-ciutatis-compat build
pnpm paperclipai plugin install ./packages/plugins/plugin-ciutatis-compat
```

